OL,3,ATwo arrested on suspicion of burglary
OL,4,Aat Prince and Princess of Wales's
OL,5,ANorfolk home
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe property was unoccupied at the
OL,8,Ftime, police added. Kensington Palace
OL,9,Fsaid it did not comment on security
OL,10,Fmatters.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
