OL,3,AIndian government has 'lost the plot',
OL,4,Asays 'cockroach' leader barred from UK
OL,5,Aflight
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the leaders of India's
OL,8,F"cockroach" movement has said the Delhi
OL,9,Fgovernment has "completely lost the
OL,10,Fplot" after he was stopped from leaving
OL,11,Fthe country for the UK.
OL,13,FSaurav Das said he was meant to board a
OL,14,Fflight on Tuesday morning but was told
OL,15,Fby immigration officers his passport
OL,16,Fhad been "flagged" because of
OL,17,Fdiscrepancies involving his date of
OL,18,Fbirth.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
